  "selection": "V1, v2, and v3 are reconstructed from the pinned source order and their frozen input, gold, and selected-ID hashes are verified before use. Every source record whose question ID matches any of the 60 prior selected IDs is excluded. Among remaining occurrences, v4 selects the two lowest SHA256(seed + source_question_id) ranks for answerable questions in each of six types. All six remaining eligible abstentions are included; they are all multi-session. Duplicate source occurrences are preserved as separate candidates and rank ties use pinned source occurrence order. Output is sorted by type, status, rank, source ID, then occurrence index. Session IDs and dates remain zipped by index with sessions. Input excludes answer and evidence markers, source question IDs, and gold labels; gold is evaluator-only.",
